  "text": "Iqa‘ Dharafat 13/8 (also spelled Zarafat) Iqa‘ Index Pronunciation of Dharafat Iqa‘ Dharafat (also spelled Zarafat) is mostly used with the Muwashah vocal genre. Using this iqa‘ outside muwashahat (e.g. in a popular song) has the effect of adding a classical color by evoking the former repertoire. Muwashah Tif Ya Durri Bil Qanani Al-Kindi Ensemble Music by ‘Umar al-Batsh The Aleppian Music Room I - Maqam Hijazkar Kurd Muwashah Wal-ladhi Wallaka Qalbi Ensemble Morkos il-Hubbi Kullo (1971) Umm Kulthum Music by Baligh Hamdi (Egypt) Mistanniyak ‘Aziza Galal Music by Baligh Hamdi (Egypt) Iqa‘ Dharafat 13/8 Tabla demonstration by Faisal Zedan",
